                "title": "Classic Solid Brass Leverset",
                "description": "Simple in design with an easy installation, this Classic Solid Brass Leverset will be perfect those looking for an elegant way to improve the style of any home. The circular rose has concealed screw mounting (installation screws are hidden). It fits most standard 2-1/8 inch bore hole door preparation. The Classic Lever is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Omnia 904 simple Lever Latchsets, OMN-904/00, omnia simple door levers, simple door levers latchsets, traditional door levers, solid brass standard door handles, classic door levers, Omnia 904/00 door levers, Omnia simple solid brass door levers, 904/00 Omnia solid brass door levers, passage levers, privacy levers, dummy levers, Classic Door Levers, ada compliant levers, traditional levers, omnia traditions collection"
